{"id":"n29021-1-9","stage":2,"title":"짐작 · 估计","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29021-1-9-1","ko":"도대체 사람들이 얼마나 온 걸까?","zh":"到底来了多少人啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도대체","meaning":"到底，究竟","explanation":"도대체：到底，究竟","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"3","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"걸까?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸까","audio":"/audio/992653d41a01574791b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5961e5da228541d4","term":"도대체","zh":"到底，究竟","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3","entryId":"14385","definition":"非常好奇而问的话。","pronunciation":["도대체"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d68b8b0d969dc1bfd11.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29021-1-9-2","ko":"내 짐작에는 백 명 정도가 모인 것 같은데.","zh":"我估计聚集了大约一百人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"짐작에는","meaning":"估计，估量，估摸","explanation":"짐작：估计，估量，估摸；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"짐작","audio":"/audio/de244c905b2057f057bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29021","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐작에는","audio":"/audio/da57254e097535a5d453.mp3"}},{"text":"백","meaning":"百","explanation":"백：百","readings":[{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36019","senseId":"1","lemma":"백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}},{"text":"명","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}},{"text":"정도가","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도가","audio":"/audio/ea858fe4c9dd6253966d.mp3"}},{"text":"모인","meaning":"聚集（人群）","explanation":"모이다 在此指多个人来到同一个地方、聚集起来；句中没有指定召集者。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모인","audio":"/audio/75406679877344cdcb8e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"某种事情或情况（把前面的内容名词化）","explanation":"모인 것 指人们已经聚集的情况；后面的 같다 对该情况作推测，不表示尚未发生的未来计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像、看来（推测）","explanation":"같다：好像、看来（推测）；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"de244c905b2057f0","term":"짐작","zh":"估计，估量，估摸","audio":"/audio/de244c905b2057f057bc.mp3","entryId":"29021","definition":"大致地推断情况或处境。","pronunciation":["짐작"]},{"id":"f30a48779ab0b5cd","term":"백","zh":"百","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3","entryId":"36019","definition":"十的十倍的数目。","pronunciation":["백"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"左右","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"那样的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"ea6fae0a54340254","term":"모이다","zh":"聚集（人群）","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3","entryId":"91162","definition":"聚集（人群）","pronunciation":["모이다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"某种事情或情况（把前面的内容名词化）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"某种事情或情况（把前面的内容名词化）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像、看来（推测）","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"好像、看来（推测）","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e33bfce77ae54464f7a4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.565,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29021","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我猜大概有上百人吧。","我昨天看到你的演唱，唱得简直不输给专业歌手呢。","到底来了多少人啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我估计聚集了大约一百人。","到底来了多少人啊？","我昨天看到你的演唱，唱得简直不输给专业歌手呢。"],"answer":0}]}
